  "description": "Trapped in a formation for 200 years of secluded training.\nHe finally perfected the supreme martial arts and returned, and yet...\n\n“We have a bit of a problem.”  \n\"What is it?\"  \n\"We have no money. No money at all.\"\n\nHe returned only to find his clan completely ruined?!\n\nThe fastest way to rebuild a fallen clan\nis to open an academy and make money!\n\n\"Honored Ancestor, how strong are your martial arts, exactly?\"  \n\"My martial arts are the greatest under heaven.\"\n\nNo longer the Jegal Clan of strategy,   \nit shall be reborn as the Jegal Clan of martial might!\n\n“I will rebuild the Jegal Clan. Together with you.”\n\nJegal Muhyeok—his martial arts, defying all common sense, take the entire Murim by storm!\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12418035) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=857374), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14978316)",
